# 安装 VS Code 插件 REST Client

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8309

### GET 请求
# GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### POST 请求
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id":"example-user",
    "session_id":"example-session",
    "history":[],
    "message":"你好，请解释业务智能体。"
}

### OCR recognize：数据池内的照片路径
POST {{baseUrl}}/ocr/recognize
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "path":"projects/现场照片.jpg"
}

### OCR recognize：base64 图片（path 与 img 至少提供一个）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ocr/recognize
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "img":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"
}

### 携带 Token
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
# Authorization: Bearer your-token
